  "interpretation": "<ul>\n<li data-start=\"958\" data-end=\"1170\">\n<p data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"1170\"><strong data-start=\"960\" data-end=\"972\">Reactive</strong>: Indicates <strong data-start=\"984\" data-end=\"1013\">current or past infection</strong> with <em data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1039\">Treponema pallidum</em>. Further evaluation with <strong data-start=\"1065\" data-end=\"1089\">non-treponemal tests</strong> (e.g., RPR or VDRL) is recommended for disease activity and treatment follow-up.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1171\" data-end=\"1306\">\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1306\"><strong data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1189\">Non-Reactive</strong>: No evidence of treponemal antibody. Suggests <strong data-start=\"1236\" data-end=\"1277\">no current or past syphilis infection</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1282\" data-end=\"1305\">early window period</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
